config LORA_RN2483
	bool "Microchip RN2483 LoRa module (AT-style UART commands)"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_MICROCHIP_RN2483_ENABLED
	select LORA
	help
	  Out-of-tree driver for the Microchip RN2483 LoRa/LoRaWAN module.
	  There is no in-tree Zephyr driver for this exact module (only for
	  bare Semtech transceivers, or Reyax's AT-command modules via
	  drivers/lora/rylrxxx.c).